{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"77120602c2495d523e885a96f5704a61a4f19bc38430fa3a76718efa371dff06","ja":"藤の花の下での撮影なんて本当に素敵で、\nスタッフさんからも、すごく褒められてたじゃない。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"707045cc010788bb010352cd8b679d7bed298369f58bba02d0e95d831424193e","ja":"えっ、あれは本当に褒めていただいていたの\nですか！？　私はてっきり、お世辞かと……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"9c4f1d32e115b5db47affd581a5d152de44e5f3c6097813227d74b82627a8b37","ja":"……うふふっ♪　まさか、紬ちゃんが\n私と同じことを考えていたなんてね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"dab952ab58087e5f4ab8220cc44e5e0557b5a66acd8851343b1b106be5bdb265","ja":"同じことって……もしかして、桜守さんもですか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"e15e2f87faf59bfc4fab86478523d74769693bbc89028e64080b0d622823e160","ja":"ええ。私も紬ちゃんみたいにエレガントに\n振舞わなきゃって思って、すごく緊張しちゃってたの。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"0e6b33e49608053b777a02542270ffc84ef0cdc117692fbd675fd9a4a025edb2","ja":"で、ですが、桜守さんこそ、\nスタッフの方に褒められてましたのに……？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"2f3db983c5e5a6b0f79504ecd80bc1ab0713a5ba8fcef50ed081363493b40932","ja":"言われてみればそうだったかも。緊張しすぎてて、\nその時は頭に入ってこなかったみたいね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1250.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"f702802f2ebfad3b7f77f9215472bbd91dea89643126e77f1fb985d3d1a96501","ja":"……それではお互い、今日の撮影は\nうまくいったのですね。安心いたしました。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
